  MAGE ID marketing-site sitemap — https://mageid.app
  Marketing-audit M4 fix.

  Hand-maintained for now. When the marketing-site CMS or page-count grows,
  swap this for a build-time generator that walks marketing/**/*.html and
  excludes pages with <meta name="robots" content="noindex">.

  Excluded by design:
  - /portal/, /sub-portal/, /architect/ — token-gated, noindex
