                                         crawlable /builders/ index is backlog.
  - /unsubscribe, /preferences        — functional email subdirs
  - /thanks.html                       — form-submission landing
  - /404.html                          — error page
  - /app-store-screenshots/, /screenshots/ — internal previews
-->
